// Putting at most one synthesis item into a finished plan. plan_main_count counts
// the main-set rows; plan_synthesis_place replaces the last new-concept row of the
// main set with the item or, with no such row and room left, inserts it after the
// last main row; plan_with_synthesis picks the item (synthesis_pick.id) and places
// it. A plan made for a learner with nothing unlocked is left exactly as it was.

plan_main_count(Plan_session plan_session) {
  int plan_counted = 0;
  int plan_at = 0;
  while (plan_at < len(plan_session.phases)) {
    plan_counted = plan_counted + (plan_session.phases[plan_at] == "main");
    plan_at = plan_at + 1;
  }
} return int plan_counted;
